AB  - The dynamism in technology makes it essential for organizations to update their old applications to newer ones. This paper explores how Generative AI (Gen AI) can transform the application modernization through automation of key tasks such as code refactoring, system refactoring and security integration. In the case of Gen AI, the applicability of various modern tools and methodologies such as cloud migration, microservices architecture, and automation frameworks, including DevOps, and emerging players in DevSecOps. This paper demonstrates how Gen AI as an organizational change supports continuous delivery, security integration, and operation resilience. In addition, the research examines cloud computing, microservices architecture, and DevOps for application modernization. It also addresses how Generative AI improves modernization enablers to optimize productivity, velocity, and project success. Through insights from case study, the work indicates GenAI produces 40-70 percent improvement in modernization cost, speed and accuracy. Finally, a structured framework is also proposed to help the organizations in adoption of GenAI for efficient and sustainable modernization.
